    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306-a1">

                <pb facs="0562" n="502" xml:id="pg502"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[From the Diario Oficial, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1868-06-10">June 10,
                        1868</date>.—Translation.]</dateline></opener>
                <head>Department of foreign relations–Section of Chancelleria.</head>
                <p>The citizen Sebastian Lerdo de Tejada, having separated from the charge of this
                    department on account of the supreme court of justice having refused the license
                    asked by the government, that he might leave the exercise of the functions of
                    president of the said court in order to continue in the ministry, the
                    undersigned, in his character of chief clerk, remains in charge of this
                    department.</p>
                <p>I communicate the same to you, by direction of the President of the republic, for
                    the consequent ends.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">Independence and liberty!
                            <placeName>Mexico</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1868-06-10">June 10, 1868</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MANUEL AZPIROZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The Citizen——.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
